  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Hu Immortal blessed land, under the light of wisdom, Fang Yuan finishes this killer move. On an immortal zombie body he can cast it about three times; more than that can kill even his soul. He treats the pair of killer moves as the crystallization of his wisdom path and poison path attainment, and as a base for further creation under the light of wisdom.",
      "chapters": [
        745
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Woman’s Heart, which he had planned to discard, becomes the core of this move and sits at the right of his chest, purple-black, wrapped in poisonous energy, and tied into his bloodstream so zombie blood carries poison through the body. Reverse-refinement assisting Gu draw out Woman’s Heart’s strength under its nurture-and-refinement property, so the normally consumable Immortal Gu can be used repeatedly by extracting poison slowly. Traces of harboring malicious heart remain in that arrangement. He still rates poison spit as incomplete and expects later improvement with Wisdom Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        748
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_womans_heart",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a duel against Zheng Ling he spits and casts it for the first time in combat; Zheng Ling is poisoned at once.",
      "chapters": [
        867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-open-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zheng_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later earthly calamity the same move works well against treemen, rotting dozens of them, but he cannot cast it continuously until he clears poison from his body. Against spring dawn jade orioles it is useless, and against a giant disaster blazing tree the airborne poison is burned away.",
      "chapters": [
        1112
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-open-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against ancient eagle hounds he judges poison spit a waste of immortal essence because of their poison resistance.",
      "chapters": [
        1138
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-open-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
